    {
      "id": "CVE-2026-73453",
      "publishedDate": "2026-09-16T09:46:33.548Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-09-16T13:42:00.799Z",
      "description": "An unauthenticated P4Runtime (Programming Protocol-Independent Packet Processors Runtime) client can achieve arbitrary code execution under certain conditions on affected platforms running Arista EOS configured with P4Runtime. P4Runtime is disabled by default in Arista EOS. By crafting a malicious packet during the initiation of a P4Runtime session, an attacker can obtain complete administrative control over the compromised switch.\n\nThis issue was discovered internally by Arista, and the company is not aware of any malicious exploitation of this vulnerability in customer networks.",
      "severity": 10,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：Arista Networks EOS\n🔓 漏洞类型：Code Injection (CWE-94)\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "https://www.arista.com/en/support/advisories-notices/security-advisory/24730-security-advisory-0174",
          "type": "reference"
        }
